{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Complex.Circle","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.beta3_via_class","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.beta3_via_class","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L147-L159","doc":"**Sample (`prop:cyclotomic-l-value-decomposition`-style)\ndownstream theorem.**\n\nGiven any instance of `TheoremA`, the predicted closed-form\nvalue at `K = 4` equals `β(3) = π³ / 32`.  The proof goes\nvia the class's `value_at_4` field (which the default\ninstance satisfies by the verified `beta3_from_jonquiere`).\nThis demonstrates the conditional-class pattern:\ndownstream content is **fully verified** modulo a named\nclass instance. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.defaultTheoremB","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.defaultTheoremB","kind":"instance","line":130,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L130-L143","doc":"**Default instance for Theorem B — verified case only.**\n\nSame Copilot-noted concern as `TheoremA`: a `True`-valued\ndefault would silently prove `agrees_at N` for every `N`.\nRestrict to the verified index `N = 5`; the `N = 5`\narithmetic is verified by `field_simp; ring`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremB.value_at_5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremB.value_at_5","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L127-L127","doc":"The witness value at `N = 5`: `-(24/25) · ζ(3)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremB.agrees_at_5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremB.agrees_at_5","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L125-L125","doc":"The `N = 5` case (the Bring / `ζ_5` row) is the canonical\nverified arithmetic content. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremB.agrees_at","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremB.agrees_at","kind":"def","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L122-L122","doc":"At `N`, the analytic and closed-form values agree. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremB.zeta3_value","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremB.zeta3_value","kind":"def","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L120-L120","doc":"The Apéry constant `ζ(3)`, supplied symbolically. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremB.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremB.mk","kind":"ctor","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L118-L118","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremB","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremB","kind":"class","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L112-L128","doc":"**Theorem B as a Lean class.**\n\nEncodes `prop:cyclotomic-cl3-orbit-sum-general`: the orbit\nsum `Σ_k Cl_3(2π k / N)` equals `-((N²-1)/N²) · ζ(3)` at\nevery `N ≥ 2`.  Conditional content identical in shape to\n`TheoremA`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.instTheoremA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.instTheoremA","kind":"instance","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L99-L110","doc":"**Default instance for Theorem A — verified case only.**\n\nPer Copilot review: an `agrees_at _ := True` default would\nsilently prove `agrees_at K` for every `K`, undermining the\nconditional-class boundary that this class is meant to\nenforce.  Restrict `agrees_at` to the **verified** index\n`K = 4`; downstream consumers wanting larger `K` must furnish\ntheir own (substantive) `TheoremA` instance. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremA.value_at_4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremA.value_at_4","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L97-L97","doc":"The witness value at `K = 4` is `β(3) = π³ / 32`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremA.agrees_at_4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremA.agrees_at_4","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L95-L95","doc":"The `K = 4` case is **always** discharged via the verified\narithmetic identity `imLi3ZetaPredicted 4 = beta3`.  This\nis the canonical \"default\" content the class commits to. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremA.agrees_at","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremA.agrees_at","kind":"def","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L91-L91","doc":"At `K`, the analytic and closed-form values agree.  Stated\nas a pure proposition; concrete instances discharge it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremA.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremA.mk","kind":"ctor","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L88-L88","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.TheoremA","kind":"class","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L75-L97","doc":"**Theorem A as a Lean class.**\n\nEncodes the manuscript's Theorem A\n(`prop:cyclotomic-trilog-imaginary-closed-form`): at every\nroot of unity index `K ≥ 2`, the analytic value\n`Im Li_3(ζ_K)` agrees with the closed form\n`imLi3ZetaPredicted K`.\n\nThe class field `agrees_at` is a proposition keyed by `K`;\ndownstream theorems require it at specific `K`.  The trivial\ndefault instance discharges the `K = 4` case using the\nverified `beta3_from_jonquiere` arithmetic, leaving other\n`K` as opaque per-instance commitments. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.beta3_from_jonquiere","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.beta3_from_jonquiere","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L61-L71","doc":"**Arithmetic core of `prop:cyclotomic-l-value-decomposition`.**\nTheorem A specialised at `K = 4` equals `β(3)`: the rational\ncoefficient `(3 · 2)/(3 · 64) = 6/192 = 1/32`.\n\nPer Copilot review: `ring` alone may not close goals involving\ndivision by numeric constants in every Mathlib version; clear\ndenominators with `field_simp` first, then `ring`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.beta3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.beta3","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L58-L59","doc":"Catalan-like depth-3 L-value: `β(3) = π³ / 32`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.cl3OrbitSumPredicted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.cl3OrbitSumPredicted","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L48-L56","doc":"Closed-form RHS predicted by **Theorem B**\n(`prop:cyclotomic-cl3-orbit-sum-general`): for `N ≥ 2`,\n\n  `Σ_{k=1..N-1} Cl_3(2π k / N) = -((N² - 1)/N²) · ζ(3)`.\n\n`zeta3` is supplied symbolically (Mathlib has `Real.zeta` but\nno Real.zeta 3 specialised closed form). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.imLi3ZetaPredicted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm.imLi3ZetaPredicted","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Infra/Polylogarithm.lean#L36-L46","doc":"Closed-form RHS predicted by **Theorem A**\n(`prop:cyclotomic-trilog-imaginary-closed-form`): for every\nroot-of-unity index `K ≥ 2`,\n\n  `Im Li_3(ζ_K) = (K − 1)(K − 2) π³ / (3 K³)`.\n\nThis `def` carries no analytic content; identification with\nthe actual `Im Li_3(exp(2π i / K))` is the substantive\nTheorem A. ","signatureChunk":0}]}